       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MENU-WORKER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 EIBAID PIC X.
       01 EIBCALEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
       01 EIBTRNID PIC X(4).
       01 WS-MESSAGE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
       01 WS-COMMAREA PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
       COPY BNK1MAI.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO BNK1MEO.
           CALL STATIC "COBCICS_START"
             USING EIBAID EIBCALEN EIBTRNID.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGEO.
           EVALUATE TRUE
             WHEN EIBCALEN = ZERO
               MOVE 'COBOL MENU READY' TO MESSAGEO
             WHEN EIBAID = X'7D'
               MOVE LENGTH OF ACTIONI TO ACTIONL
               CALL STATIC "COBCICS_GET_FIELD"
                 USING "ACTION  " ACTIONI ACTIONL ACTIONF
               STRING 'COBOL MENU ACTION ' ACTIONI
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO MESSAGEO
               END-STRING
             WHEN EIBAID = X'6D'
               MOVE 'COBOL AID 6D' TO MESSAGEO
             WHEN EIBAID = X'F3'
               MOVE 'COBOL AID F3' TO MESSAGEO
             WHEN OTHER
               MOVE 'COBOL OTHER AID' TO MESSAGEO
           END-EVALUATE.
           MOVE LENGTH OF MESSAGEO TO WS-MESSAGE-LEN.
           CALL STATIC "COBCICS_SEND_FIELD"
             USING "MESSAGE " MESSAGEO WS-MESSAGE-LEN.
           IF EIBAID NOT = X'F3'
               MOVE 1 TO WS-MESSAGE-LEN
               CALL STATIC "COBCICS_SET_RETURN"
                 USING "OMEN" WS-COMMAREA WS-MESSAGE-LEN
           END-IF.
           CALL STATIC "COBCICS_FINISH".
           GOBACK.
